  <p id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0000" ref="lq1_g7a_qay">結</persName>字叔連，少與<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0007" ref="1ao_22d_odr">系</persName>齊名。辟公府掾，累遷黃門侍郎，歷散騎常恃、豫州刺史、魏郡太守、御史中丞。時<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0045" ref="8x5_e5i_yle">孫秀</persName>亂關中，<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0051" ref="lq1_g7a_qay">結</persName>在都，坐議<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0057" ref="8x5_e5i_yle">秀</persName>罪應誅，<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0062" ref="8x5_e5i_yle">秀</persName>由是致憾。及<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0069" ref="1ao_22d_odr">系</persName>被害，<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0073" ref="lq1_g7a_qay">結</persName>亦同戮。<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0078" ref="y4s_egx_auf">女</persName>適裴氏，明日當嫁，而禍起，裴氏欲認活之，女曰：「家既若此，我何活為！」亦坐死。朝廷遂議革舊制，女不從坐，由<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0132" ref="lq1_g7a_qay">結</persName>女始也。後贈<persName id="c-jinshu-060-xiejie:p001:m0139" ref="lq1_g7a_qay">結</persName>光祿大夫，改葬，加弔祭。</p>
</text>
